%U A336071 790642312941342,12468107007679066,206470175901327114,3582261505674393402,64982471520043757248
%N A336071 Number of inversion sequences avoiding the vincular pattern 1-01 (or 1-10).
%C A336071 An inversion sequence e avoids the vincular pattern 1-01 if and only if for every k in {2, ..., n}, whenever e_k > e_{k-1}, the entry e_k has not appeared previously in the prefix (e_1, ..., e_{k-1}). - _David Mahler_, Oct 02 2026
%H A336071 Juan S. Auli and Sergi Elizalde, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.11533">Wilf equivalences between vincular patterns in inversion sequences</a>, arXiv:2003.11533 [math.CO], 2020. See p. 5, Table 1. Gives terms 1-10.
